<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96185" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμ-ίον</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάθμιον</span></b> , τό, 
			Dim.
		 (in form) of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111
				</span></i>
			, <i>weight of a balance</i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a specific
			weight of wool, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				116.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				117.17
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>standard weight</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς., ἃ ὁ δῆμος σηκῶσαι ἐψηφίσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1388.46
				</span></i>
			, al., cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				19.35
			</span></i>, al.; <i>balance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.27
			</span></i> (and so perh. in ll.cc. supr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>plummet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				21.13
			</span></i>.</div>
